<p dir="auto">This PR specifically:</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Adds a guide under the CSS values and units module explaining what it is, and showing some examples.</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Adds short sections to the function pages that this new behavior is relevant to (<code class="notranslate">calc()</code>. <code class="notranslate">abs()</code> and <code class="notranslate">sign()</code> for now, although other functions might be relevant too), and edits any mentions of typed arithmetic rules that are rendered out-of-date by this update.</li>
</ul>

